Situation:
I joined CBA nine months ago and was assigned a modernization project for products in REX, which involves migrating:
•	200+ Tableau dashboards
•	Complex workflows built in Pega
The goal is to replace these legacy systems with a modern microservices-based cloud architecture. The primary challenge lies in the complexity of Tableau and Pega, requiring specialized expertise from existing teams. Additionally, we rely on both onshore and offshore teams managing these technologies, making collaboration crucial.
________________________________________
Task:
To effectively drive the project forward, I needed to:
✔ Understand the existing system – Conduct an in-depth analysis of Tableau and Pega implementations.
✔ Engage with business users – Gather insights into critical functionalities and use cases.
✔ Perform a detailed technical analysis – Document architecture, data flow, and integration patterns.
✔ Conduct Proof of Concepts (POCs) – Validate feasibility and improvements.
✔ Ensure seamless collaboration – Work across teams without disrupting their ongoing priorities.
✔ Automate CI/CD and testing – Implement reliable pipelines to accelerate deployments while maintaining quality.
________________________________________
Action (Breaking Down Workstreams)
1. Tableau Dashboards Modernization:
✅ Partnered with onshore and offshore Tableau teams to analyze current dashboard usage, dependencies, and pain points.
✅ Worked closely with business users to understand use cases, ensuring that the new solution aligns with their needs.
✅ Conducted a POC for selected dashboards, demonstrating performance improvements and cloud integration benefits.
✅ Designed a scalable data pipeline for seamless data ingestion and visualization.
✅ Established a phased migration plan that minimized disruptions to reporting workflows.
2. Pega Workflow Transformation:
✅ Engaged with Pega specialists to assess existing workflows and business rules.
✅ Conducted a POC for re-architecting workflows in a microservices-based system, showcasing improved flexibility and automation.
✅ Defined a structured migration strategy, ensuring compliance with regulatory and operational requirements.
✅ Integrated key functionalities into the new system while maintaining business continuity.
