✔ Created a cross-functional team with members from both Sydney and India, ensuring 24/7 progress and faster decision-making.
✔ Managed dependencies across teams by scheduling non-intrusive knowledge-sharing sessions.
✔ Ensured that onshore and offshore teams could continue their deliverables without disruptions.
✔ Facilitated cross-team discussions, proactively identifying roadblocks and aligning stakeholders to drive project success.
